different\n    30|scopes. Skipping an intermediate phase write breaks per-phase crash recovery.\n    31|\n    32|### Session Start\n    33|\n    34|```\n    35|CONTEXT_PACK_PATH = ./context-pack\n    36|\n    37|IF exists({CONTEXT_PACK_PATH}/active-context.md):\n    38|  READ active-context.md\n    39|  EXTRACT: prior_session_id, status, current_focus, open_blockers, decisions_log\n    40|  LOG: \"Memory Bank: loaded active-context from session {prior_session_id}\"\n    41|  # Use to: avoid re-discovering known blockers, continue from prior state,\n    42|  #         respect decisions already made (do not contradict them)\n    43|ELSE:\n    44|  LOG: \"Memory Bank: No active-context.md found. First session.\"\n    45|\n    46|IF exists({CONTEXT_PACK_PATH}/progress.md):\n    47|  READ progress.md\n    48|  EXTRACT: milestone_count, last_milestone\n    49|ELSE:\n    50|  LOG: \"Memory Bank: No progress.md found. First session.\"\n    51|\n    52|# Write active-context.md at session START (crash recovery — mandatory)\n    53|WRITE {CONTEXT_PACK_PATH}/active-context.md:\n    54|  ---\n    55|  document_type: active-context\n    56|  session_id: {SESSION_ID}\n    57|  capability: {capability_name}\n    58|  skill: {skill_name}\n    59|  project: {project_name}\n    60|  last_updated: {ISO timestamp}\n    61|  status: STARTING\n    62|  ---\n    63|  # Active Context: {project_name}\n    64|  ## Current Focus\n    65|  Session {SESSION_ID} initializing. Skill: {skill_name}. Mode: {BUILD | REPAIR}.\n    66|  ## Prior Session Context\n    67|  {IF prior loaded: Previous: {prior_session_id} — status: {prior_status}. Include blockers/decisions.}\n    68|  {ELSE: First session — no prior context.}\n    69|  ## Open Blockers\n    70|  {Copy from prior session if any, else \"None.\"}\n    71|```\n    72|\n    73|### Session End\n    74|\n    75|```\n    76|# 1. Overwrite active-context.md with final state\n    77|WRITE {CONTEXT_PACK_PATH}/active-context.md:\n    78|  ---\n    79|  status: {COMPLETED | FAILED | BLOCKED}\n    80|  session_id: {SESSION_ID}\n</file>","isError":false,"durationMs":5}}
