 | {capability} | {skill_name} | {STATUS} | {N <artifact-type>} | {1-line note} |\n   116|  # {N <artifact-type>} MUST use the specific type from the registry below.\n   117|  # Examples: \"12 tasks (4 phases)\", \"48 files, 32 tests\", \"17 review-findings\"\n   118|  # NEVER write: \"1 artifact\", \"N artifacts\", or leave blank.\n   119|```\n   120|\n   121|Both writes are **MANDATORY** — even on failure, record the failure state.\n   122|\n   123|### Verification After Writing progress.md\n   124|\n   125|```\n   126|VERIFY exists(context-pack/progress.md)\n   127|IF NOT exists: LOG \"ERROR: write FAILED. Retrying.\" → RETRY (mandatory tool call)\n   128|IF still fails: LOG \"CRITICAL: Memory Bank write failed. Manual intervention required.\"\n   129|\n   130|READ last line — VERIFY it contains SESSION_ID AND specific artifact count (not \"N artifacts\")\n   131|IF generic: REWRITE the row with the correct count from the registry.\n   132|\n   133|LOG: \"Memory Bank: progress.md verified — {N} rows. Last: {SESSION_ID} | {artifact_count}\"\n   134|```\n   135|\n   136|This verification is **NON-NEGOTIABLE**.\n   137|\n   138|### Artifact Type Registry\n   139|\n   140|| Skill | Artifact Type | Example |\n   141||-------|--------------|---------|\n   142|| `researching-adrs` | ADRs | `12 ADRs` |\n   143|| `researching-bounded-contexts` | bounded-contexts | `7 bounded-contexts` |\n   144|| `establishing-architecture-foundation` | services | `9 services` |\n   145|| `specifying-architecture` | architecture-docs | `3 architecture-docs` |\n   146|| `researching-prd` | requirements | `24 requirements` |\n   147|| `planning-epics` | epics | `15 epics` |\n   148|| `plan-epics-definition` | epics | `12 epics` |\n   149|| `implementing-user-stories` | user-stories | `48 user-stories` |\n   150|| `researching-code-design` | research-docs | `20 research-docs` |\n   151|| `planning-code-tasks` | tasks | `12 tasks (4 phases)` |\n   152|| `implementing-code` | source-files + tests | `48 files, 32 tests` |\n   153|| `reviewing-code` | review-findings | `17 review-findings` |\n   154|| `researching-code-change` | research-briefs | `1 research-brief` |\n   155|| `planning-code-change` | plan-specs | `1 plan-spec (3 phases)` |\n   156|| `implementing-code-change` | source-files + tests | `6 files, 4 tests` |\n   157|| `reviewing-code-change` | review-findings | `3 review-findings` |\n   158|| `reviewing-code-plan` | plan-review-findings | `2 plan-review-findings` |\n   159|| `adversarial-platform-review` | conformance-findings | `4 conformance-findings (B1-B4 BLOCKER)` |\n</file>","isError":false,"durationMs":5}}
